{"data":{"id":"-1XQpYWV-E0","slug":"so-ho","title":"So:Ho","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"VFDhhIxmfxU","slug":"hot-music","title":"Hot Music"},{"id":"vNgptNrbXI4","slug":"hot-remix-orijanus-feat-teklun-and-zikomo","title":"Hot Remix - Orijanus feat. Tek.Lun & Zikomo"},{"id":"XnBk4_RK3Zg","slug":"hot-music-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Hot Music (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)"},{"id":"mtmh8bL6J8g","slug":"more-hot-music","title":"More Hot Music"}]},"markers":[{"id":"pnwShPWIgK8","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SO:HO - Hot Music","track":{"id":"VFDhhIxmfxU","path":"/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music/","slug":"hot-music","title":"Hot Music","artist":{"slug":"so-ho","title":"So:Ho"},"artwork":"images/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"kPQ0ItJeaoE","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SO:HO - Hot Music","track":{"id":"VFDhhIxmfxU","path":"/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music/","slug":"hot-music","title":"Hot Music","artist":{"slug":"so-ho","title":"So:Ho"},"artwork":"images/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"lvLR-jIK1BU","slug":"145","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #145","artwork":"/images/episodes/145.jpg","content":"\nJoe selects 60 minutes of energy from Soulection HQ\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3662,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"upCc9SQHGkg","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SO:HO - Hot Music","track":{"id":"VFDhhIxmfxU","path":"/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music/","slug":"hot-music","title":"Hot Music","artist":{"slug":"so-ho","title":"So:Ho"},"artwork":"images/artists/so-ho/tracks/hot-music.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Ybmts7hOhJk","position":69,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SO:HO - Hot Music","track":{"id":"VFDhhIxmfxU","path":"/artists/so-ho